{"id":"n27116-2-7","stage":2,"title":"유물 · 遗物","scene":"文化与休闲","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n27116-2-7-1","ko":"목걸이가 참 예쁘네요.","zh":"这条项链真漂亮啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"목걸이가","meaning":"项链","explanation":"목걸이：项链；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"목걸이","audio":"/audio/1b565ae8e86d1ff1a554.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16150","senseId":"1","lemma":"목걸이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"목걸이가","audio":"/audio/36480c5e1185b936a9b5.mp3"}},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}},{"text":"예쁘네요.","meaning":"漂亮，好看","explanation":"예쁘다：漂亮，好看；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"예쁘다","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89697","senseId":"1","lemma":"예쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"예쁘네요","audio":"/audio/153dcbd9010426824b29.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1b565ae8e86d1ff1","term":"목걸이","zh":"项链","audio":"/audio/1b565ae8e86d1ff1a554.mp3","entryId":"16150","definition":"将宝石等穿在线绳上后挂在脖颈上的装饰品。","pronunciation":["목꺼리"]},{"id":"8e09b5f4c09195e3","term":"참","zh":"真，实在，的确","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3","entryId":"71761","definition":"毫不违背事实或道理，真正地。","pronunciation":["참"]},{"id":"f62ff8982d788e72","term":"예쁘다","zh":"漂亮，好看","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3","entryId":"89697","definition":"长相看起来美丽，让人喜欢。","pronunciation":["예ː쁘다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a7c5bf991a8dd181114c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n27116-2-7-2","ko":"아, 이 목걸이는 돌아가신 할머니께서 제게 남겨 주신 유물이에요.","zh":"啊，这条项链是我已故的奶奶留给我的一件传家宝呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아,","meaning":"哦","explanation":"아：哦","readings":[{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16247","senseId":"4","lemma":"아","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}},{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"목걸이는","meaning":"项链","explanation":"목걸이：项链；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"목걸이","audio":"/audio/1b565ae8e86d1ff1a554.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16150","senseId":"1","lemma":"목걸이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"목걸이는","audio":"/audio/fcdc38bb02d679ad6c21.mp3"}},{"text":"돌아가신","meaning":"去世，逝世","explanation":"돌아가다：去世，逝世；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"돌아가다","audio":"/audio/1152d7a56fb1600a5774.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74103","senseId":"7","lemma":"돌아가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돌아가신","audio":"/audio/bfc4d873fbdb148d3d22.mp3"}},{"text":"할머니께서","meaning":"奶奶，姥姥","explanation":"할머니：奶奶，姥姥；께서：이/가 的敬语形式，标记受到尊敬的主语。","readings":[{"term":"할머니","audio":"/audio/8dc4d6918deb0b6e1d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27375","senseId":"1","lemma":"할머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할머니께서","audio":"/audio/9fe73e6f9fd2da1e208f.mp3"}},{"text":"제게","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제게","audio":"/audio/2846f148eec562e3151f.mp3"}},{"text":"남겨","meaning":"留传，留下","explanation":"남기다：留传，留下；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"남기다","audio":"/audio/a129ccc910d85b760984.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64371","senseId":"5","lemma":"남기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남겨","audio":"/audio/4e11f95d17e970a4632f.mp3"}},{"text":"주신","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주신","audio":"/audio/9d3c5e0f5b506f100919.mp3"}},{"text":"유물이에요.","meaning":"遗物","explanation":"유물：遗物；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"유물","audio":"/audio/68c717bd5b0f0e20f0a1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27116","senseId":"2","lemma":"유물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유물이에요","audio":"/audio/57edae1fa3e35e5768e3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d6ce479be9ddc9b7","term":"아","zh":"哦","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3","entryId":"16247","definition":"由不知道而转向醒悟时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["아"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"1b565ae8e86d1ff1","term":"목걸이","zh":"项链","audio":"/audio/1b565ae8e86d1ff1a554.mp3","entryId":"16150","definition":"将宝石等穿在线绳上后挂在脖颈上的装饰品。","pronunciation":["목꺼리"]},{"id":"1152d7a56fb1600a","term":"돌아가다","zh":"去世，逝世","audio":"/audio/1152d7a56fb1600a5774.mp3","entryId":"74103","definition":"(尊称)死去。","pronunciation":["도라가다"]},{"id":"8dc4d6918deb0b6e","term":"할머니","zh":"奶奶，姥姥","audio":"/audio/8dc4d6918deb0b6e1d10.mp3","entryId":"27375","definition":"用于指称或称呼父亲的母亲或母亲的母亲。","pronunciation":["할머니"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"a129ccc910d85b76","term":"남기다","zh":"留传，留下","audio":"/audio/a129ccc910d85b760984.mp3","entryId":"64371","definition":"把财产等传给后代。","pronunciation":["남기다"]},{"id":"1b43f195